[{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0010","text":"────雾子！辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0020","text":"再过一会儿就是移动时间了\n能出发吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0030","text":"……好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0040","text":"日程排得这么满，抱歉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0050","text":"不会……\n谢谢您……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0060","text":"我好好……\n休息了一下……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0070","text":"哈哈……\n你这么说我很高兴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0080","text":"不过，最近连让L'Antica的大家聚在一起的时间\n都很难安排出来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0090","text":"……有点担心呢\n不知道大家相处得好不好────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0100","text":"制作人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0110","text":"……不，抱歉\n我会想办法调整日程的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0120","text":"毕竟雾子除了工作和学业之外，\n还在做医院的志愿者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0130","text":"我觉得真的很了不起"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0140","text":"…………\n没有……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0150","text":"今天，是在做撕纸画吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0160","text":"……是的……是患者们的……\n作业活动的……一环……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0170","text":"在做牵牛花的……\n撕纸画……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0180","text":"一张一张……\n一点一点……贴上去……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0190","text":"马上就要……\n完成了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0200","text":"嗯……\n非常漂亮"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0210","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0220","text":"这片……花瓣是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0221","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0230","text":"恋钟酱……\n贴的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0240","text":"诶，恋钟贴的……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0250","text":"还有就是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0251","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0260","text":"这根……茎是……\n咲耶小姐……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0270","text":"两片叶子是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0271","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0280","text":"摩美美酱和……\n结华酱……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0281","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0290","text":"是大家帮我贴的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0300","text":"是吗……\n大家，在空闲时间来帮忙了啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0310","text":"………那我也来帮忙贴一片，可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0320","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0330","text":"那我就……贴这边的背景……\n这里是，天空吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0340","text":"还是说……空气……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0350","text":"空气……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0360","text":"是非常……重要的东西……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0370","text":"……所以……\n牵牛花……才能活下去……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0380","text":"这是最后一片了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0390","text":"是的……这样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_03_0400","text":"完成────……"}]
